	\gamma(z)=1-\frac{q^{1/2+iz}+q^{1/2-iz}}{q+1}.
\end{equation}
 Note that the image of $S_1=\{z\in\mathbb C: |\Im z|\leq1/2\}$ under the map $\gamma$ is an elliptic region which intersects $\{w\in\mathbb{C}:|w|=1\}$ in infinitely many points.

